  "question": {
    "text": "A coil of area A and N turns is rotating with angular velocity \\(\\omega\\) in a uniform magnetic field \\(\\vec{B}\\) about an axis perpendicular to \\(\\vec{B}\\). Magnetic flux \\(\\varphi\\) and induced \\(\\operatorname{emf} \\varepsilon\\) across it, at an instant when \\(\\vec{B}\\) is parallel to the plane of coil, are :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "YJL8g",
      "text": "\\(\\varphi=\\mathrm{AB}, \\varepsilon=0\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qVFDQ",
      "text": "\\(\\varphi=0, \\varepsilon=0\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "yv30H",
      "text": "\\(\\varphi=0, \\varepsilon=\\mathrm{NAB} \\omega\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HuCJl",
      "text": "\\(\\varphi=\\mathrm{AB}, \\varepsilon=\\mathrm{NAB} \\omega\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/tRqC4OVurqIDgEyxkTpQjnBLQepjWGwUa6_bu56ua_M.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n$\\begin{aligned}\n\\phi & =\\mathrm{BAN} \\cdot \\cos (\\omega \\mathrm{t}) \\\\\n\\varepsilon & =\\frac{-\\mathrm{d} \\phi}{\\mathrm{dt}}=\\mathrm{BA} \\omega \\mathrm{~N} \\cdot \\sin (\\omega \\mathrm{t})\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nWhen $B$ is parallel to plane, $\\underline{\\underline{\\omega t}}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\phi=0, \\varepsilon=\\mathrm{BA} \\omega \\mathrm{~N}$",
    "image": null
  },
